# Local design-history copies. Kept out of the repo on purpose: anything
# committed here is served publicly by GitHub Pages, and a second copy of
# index.html would be a publicly reachable, search-indexable duplicate.
# The canonical history is the git tag v1-pre-redesign.
index.pre-redesign.html
*.pre-redesign.html

# Full-resolution photo and figure originals. The pages load the compressed
# derivatives sitting next to these (images/team-*.webp, images/castor-pal5.webp
# and so on), so the originals are kept locally only rather than published as
# multi-megabyte files nobody downloads. Add new originals here as they arrive.
/images/CASTOR_Pal5.png
/images/SMU Burke-Gafney Observatory Shoot*.jpg
/images/kristen.png
/images/mackenzie.png
/images/nolan.png
/images/vincent.png
/images/castor.001.png
/images/STRIDES_logo.png

